      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> The online lures and physical access reports overlap in people, timing, and locations, so they require a coordinated response even though attribution remains open. We can send the protected package to <b>incident command and physical security</b>, reserve detailed route data for a controlled security test, or publish a redacted public-interest summary. Staff identities, authentication data, and exploitable access details must remain protected in every path.",
      "taskInstructions": "Choose the authorized handling path for the combined evidence.",
      "taskQuestion": "How should Harborview use and share the online and physical findings?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> Recorded. The selected path defines who receives the evidence, for what purpose, and with which protections."
    }
